  "name": "Agent Team Creation Team",
  "description": "terates over provided agents to create agent workflows/teams. For each agent it prepares mappings and variables, applies retry logic and uniqueness checks, and calls the appropriate business object to create either an agent team or a workflow based on a condition, returning a workflow result for each agent",
